WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.226 --> 00:00:03.094
BAIL HIM OUT IN A JOINT

00:00:03.095 --> 00:00:03.561
STATEMENT LATER.

00:00:03.562 --> 00:00:04.295
KARL ROVE, GOOD TO SEE YOU,

00:00:04.296 --> 00:00:05.830
THANKS FOR BEING WITH US.

00:00:05.831 --> 00:00:06.864
HERE WITH REACTION TO ALL OF THE

00:00:06.865 --> 00:00:08.299
BREAKING NEWS -- YEAH,

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:11.836
ROBERT MUELLER AGREED TO END

00:00:11.837 --> 00:00:12.503
TESTIFY.

00:00:12.504 --> 00:00:13.671
THEY CHANGE THE SPECIAL COUNSEL

00:00:13.672 --> 00:00:16.507
LAW, KEN STARR IS WITH US.

00:00:16.508 --> 00:00:19.477
YOU WORKED UNDER A VERY

00:00:19.478 --> 00:00:21.412
DIFFERENT -- VERY DIFFERENT

00:00:21.413 --> 00:00:22.079
CIRCUMSTANCES.

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:22.813
YOU DIDN'T HAVE AN OPTION AS IT

00:00:22.814 --> 00:00:25.249
RELATES TO TESTIFYING.

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:28.386
IN THE ISSUE, YOU ARE COMPELLED

00:00:28.387 --> 00:00:29.387
TO RELEASE THIS.

00:00:29.388 --> 00:00:30.054
INTERESTINGLY, IT WAS PEOPLE

00:00:30.055 --> 00:00:32.657
LIKE JERRY NADLER WHO DIDN'T

00:00:32.658 --> 00:00:34.458
WANT YOUR REPORT TO BE PUBLIC,

00:00:34.459 --> 00:00:35.393
ALTHOUGH THE LAW COMPELLED IT,

00:00:35.394 --> 00:00:37.895
AND YOU TOOK A LOT OF HEAT, IF I

00:00:37.896 --> 00:00:42.867
RECALL CORRECTLY, FOR DOING YOUR

00:00:42.868 --> 00:00:44.135
JOB.

00:00:44.136 --> 00:00:46.637
&gt;&gt; THAT'S EXACTLY RIGHT, SEAN.

00:00:46.638 --> 00:00:50.241
FOR ME, IT WAS THE LONGEST DAY

00:00:50.242 --> 00:00:51.709
BACK IN NOVEMBER OF 1998.

00:00:51.710 --> 00:00:54.845
AND I THINK BOB MUELLER IS GOING

00:00:54.846 --> 00:00:57.014
TO NOW HAVE A VERY SIMILAR

00:00:57.015 --> 00:00:57.982
EXPERIENCE, AND IT WILL BE JUST

00:00:57.983 --> 00:01:00.117
AS IT WERE FOR ME, FROM THE

00:01:00.118 --> 00:01:00.885
DEMOCRATIC SIDE OF THE AISLE AT

00:01:00.886 --> 00:01:03.087
THE TIME, THEY ARE GOING TO

00:01:03.088 --> 00:01:04.922
BE -- AS YOU HAVE BEEN SAYING --

00:01:04.923 --> 00:01:06.857
AND SENATOR GRAHAM WAS SAYING --

00:01:06.858 --> 00:01:08.926
THEY'RE GOING TO BE VERY HARD

00:01:08.927 --> 00:01:09.794
QUESTIONS FOR BOB MUELLER.

00:01:09.795 --> 00:01:10.294
AND THAT'S RIGHT.

00:01:10.295 --> 00:01:14.365
IT'S THE WAY IT SHOULD BE.

00:01:14.366 --> 00:01:15.866
I SHOULD HAVE GONE UP TO

00:01:15.867 --> 00:01:16.200
TESTIFY.

00:01:16.201 --> 00:01:18.536
AND BOB MUELLER SHOULD GO UP TO

00:01:18.537 --> 00:01:18.869
TESTIFY.

00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:20.771
I GREATLY RESPECT SENATOR GRAHAM

00:01:20.772 --> 00:01:24.508
THAT IT IS OVER, BUT IN LIGHT OF

00:01:24.509 --> 00:01:25.242
THE FACT THAT SOME 70 DEMOCRATS

00:01:25.243 --> 00:01:28.045
IN THE HOUSE OF REPRESENTATIVES

00:01:28.046 --> 00:01:28.813
ARE INCLINED FOR IMPEACHMENT,

00:01:28.814 --> 00:01:30.014
THIS IS A LOGICAL STEP.

00:01:30.015 --> 00:01:31.415
AND I THINK IT IS GOING TO BE AN

00:01:31.416 --> 00:01:33.217
IMPORTANT DAY FOR THE AMERICAN

00:01:33.218 --> 00:01:33.551
PEOPLE.

00:01:33.552 --> 00:01:35.486
&gt;&gt; Sean: WELL, I DO THINK

00:01:35.487 --> 00:01:38.322
THERE ARE SOME VERY, VERY TOUGH,

00:01:38.323 --> 00:01:39.290
DIFFICULT QUESTIONS FOR

00:01:39.291 --> 00:01:39.690
BOB MUELLER.

00:01:39.691 --> 00:01:42.927
I DON'T UNDERSTAND, FOR THE LIFE

00:01:42.928 --> 00:01:43.794
OF ME, WITHOUT BROAD MANDATE, AS

00:01:43.795 --> 00:01:47.064
I'VE BEEN SAYING.

00:01:47.065 --> 00:01:48.666
DECADES-OLD -- BY THE WAY,

00:01:48.667 --> 00:01:50.434
EVERYONE PAY YOUR TAXES, DON'T

00:01:50.435 --> 00:01:51.435
LIE ON LOAN APPLICATIONS.

00:01:51.436 --> 00:01:51.836
GOT IT.

00:01:51.837 --> 00:01:53.471
DON'T LIE UNDER OATH.

00:01:53.472 --> 00:01:55.439
BUT HOW DO YOU IGNORE A BOUGHT

00:01:55.440 --> 00:02:00.444
AND PAID FOR, RUSSIAN DOSSIER

00:02:00.445 --> 00:02:03.314
THAT WAS LEAKED TO THE AMERICAN

00:02:03.315 --> 00:02:04.949
PEOPLE BY, WE BELIEVE, THE

00:02:04.950 --> 00:02:05.583
INTELLIGENCE COMMUNITY, TO

00:02:05.584 --> 00:02:07.351
IMPACT THE ELECTION.

00:02:07.352 --> 00:02:07.785
RUSSIAN LIES.

00:02:07.786 --> 00:02:11.956
WHOSE OWN AUTHOR SAYS HE DOESN'T

00:02:11.957 --> 00:02:14.091
KNOW IF ANY OF IT IS TRUE, WHICH

00:02:14.092 --> 00:02:16.527
MAKES AN UNVERIFIABLE, BUT

00:02:16.528 --> 00:02:18.195
BECOMES THE BASIS TO SPY ON NOT

00:02:18.196 --> 00:02:18.929
ONLY CARTER PAGE, AND THERE WAS

00:02:18.930 --> 00:02:22.199
OTHER SPYING ABROAD, BUT THE

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:24.068
TRUMP CAMPAIGN, TRANSITION, AND

00:02:24.069 --> 00:02:24.802
PRESIDENCY.

00:02:24.803 --> 00:02:26.170
NOW THAT WAS ALL BASED ON

00:02:26.171 --> 00:02:29.640
SOMETHING THAT IS UNVERIFIABLE,

00:02:29.641 --> 00:02:31.042
BASED ON THE OWN AUTHOR.

00:02:31.043 --> 00:02:33.244
HOW DO THEY IGNORE THAT, SIR?

00:02:33.245 --> 00:02:35.846
&gt;&gt; IT'S A VERY GOOD QUESTION.

00:02:35.847 --> 00:02:37.014
AND I THINK WHAT BOB MUELLER

00:02:37.015 --> 00:02:37.715
WILL SAY IS LOOK, THIS WAS

00:02:37.716 --> 00:02:41.852
HANDED TO ME, I DIDN'T HAVE

00:02:41.853 --> 00:02:43.387
OCCASION TO GO BACK AND LOOK AT

00:02:43.388 --> 00:02:44.789
HOW IT CAME TO ME.

00:02:44.790 --> 00:02:46.557
JUST HEY, HERE IS THE JOB, NOW

00:02:46.558 --> 00:02:47.525
GO DO THE JOB.

00:02:47.526 --> 00:02:48.226
SUPPOSED TO

00:02:51.163 --> 00:02:51.762
AS OPPOSED TO LOOKING

00:02:51.763 --> 00:02:53.564
TO THE BACKGROUND OF THE JOB.

00:02:53.565 --> 00:02:54.865
THESE ARE FAIR QUESTIONS YOU ARE

00:02:54.866 --> 00:02:57.134
RAISING, SEAN PEERED SO MANY

00:02:57.135 --> 00:03:00.071
QUESTIONS ABOUT ABOUT THE WHY,

00:03:00.072 --> 00:03:02.807
THE WHEREFORE, YOU HAVE RAISED

00:03:02.808 --> 00:03:03.307
SOME OF THEM HERE

00:03:03.308 --> 00:03:03.941
TONIGHT.

00:03:03.942 --> 00:03:04.975
I THINK IT IS GOING TO BE AN

00:03:04.976 --> 00:03:05.776
IMPORTANT DAY.

00:03:05.777 --> 00:03:07.978
I KEEP GOING BACK TO THE CONCEPT

00:03:07.979 --> 00:03:10.014
OF ACCOUNTABILITY, BECAUSE WHEN

00:03:10.015 --> 00:03:12.349
BOB MUELLER HELD HIS PRESS

00:03:12.350 --> 00:03:14.618
CONFERENCE BUT DIDN'T TAKE

00:03:14.619 --> 00:03:15.886
QUESTIONS, I THINK WE SHOULD BE

00:03:15.887 --> 00:03:19.190
CONCERNED ABOUT THAT.

00:03:19.191 --> 00:03:20.124
WHY WON'T YOU RESPOND TO

00:03:20.125 --> 00:03:22.593
QUESTIONS FROM THE PRESS?

00:03:22.594 --> 00:03:24.595
AND NOW I THINK IT IS MOST

00:03:24.596 --> 00:03:25.629
APPROPRIATE THAT HE GOES OVER TO

00:03:25.630 --> 00:03:27.832
THE PEOPLE'S HOUSE, BOTH SIDES

00:03:27.833 --> 00:03:30.034
OF THE AISLE -- DEMOCRATS,

00:03:30.035 --> 00:03:30.935
REPUBLICANS -- WANTED THIS.

00:03:30.936 --> 00:03:33.537
AND I'M GLAD IT IS GOING TO

00:03:33.538 --> 00:03:33.871
HAPPEN.

00:03:33.872 --> 00:03:37.408
&gt;&gt; Sean: DO YOU THINK HE HAS A

00:03:37.409 --> 00:03:40.377
HARD TIME ANSWERING THE PEOPLE

00:03:40.378 --> 00:03:41.245
HE APPOINTED?

00:03:41.246 --> 00:03:41.812
WEISSMANN?

00:03:41.813 --> 00:03:42.847
HOW DO YOU APPOINT

00:03:42.848 --> 00:03:45.549
HILLARY CLINTON'S ATTORNEY?

00:03:45.550 --> 00:03:46.150
HOW DO YOU ONLY APPOINT

00:03:46.151 --> 00:03:50.221
DEMOCRATS, NO REPUBLICANS?

00:03:50.222 --> 00:03:51.088
HOW DOES HE ANSWER THAT?

00:03:51.089 --> 00:03:53.190
&gt;&gt; YEAH, AND I'VE RAISED

00:03:53.191 --> 00:03:54.925
CONCERNS ABOUT THAT, REALLY,

00:03:54.926 --> 00:03:56.260
FROM THE GET-GO.

00:03:56.261 --> 00:03:57.661
JUST VERY BRIEFLY, SEAN, WHEN

00:03:57.662 --> 00:04:00.698
QUESTIONS WERE RAISED BACK

00:04:00.699 --> 00:04:02.700
DURING MY INVESTIGATION THAT OH,

00:04:02.701 --> 00:04:04.401
YOU ARE A REPUBLICAN, I REACHED

00:04:04.402 --> 00:04:05.102
OUT SPECIFICALLY TO THE OTHER

00:04:05.103 --> 00:04:08.372
SIDE OF THE AISLE BECAUSE THE

00:04:08.373 --> 00:04:10.841
APPEARANCE OF FAIRNESS AND

00:04:10.842 --> 00:04:12.376
EVENHANDEDNESS IN THE

00:04:12.377 --> 00:04:14.712
ADMINISTRATION, IT'S VERY, VERY

00:04:14.713 --> 00:04:15.112
IMPORTANT.

00:04:15.113 --> 00:04:19.049
SO WE BROUGHT IN SAM OF WATER

00:04:19.050 --> 00:04:19.783
GAINED FAME ON THE DEMOCRATIC

00:04:19.784 --> 00:04:23.754
SIDE, BROUGHT IN A DEPUTY,

00:04:23.755 --> 00:04:28.259
REGISTERED DEMOCRAT, VOTED

00:04:28.260 --> 00:04:29.660
FOR -- IT'S IMPORTANT TO GIVE

00:04:29.661 --> 00:04:30.728
THE PUBLIC ASSURANCES THAT WHAT

00:04:30.729 --> 00:04:33.597
YOU ARE DOING IS FAIR.

00:04:33.598 --> 00:04:34.465
AND IT'S EVENHANDED.

00:04:34.466 --> 00:04:37.301
THAT IS, I THINK, A VERY

00:04:37.302 --> 00:04:38.068
IMPORTANT QUESTION FOR

00:04:38.069 --> 00:04:38.836
BOB MUELLER TO ANSWER.

00:04:38.837 --> 00:04:39.970
&gt;&gt; Sean: I WAS NOT IMPRESSED

00:04:39.971 --> 00:04:41.305
WITH THE NINE AND A HALF MINUTE

00:04:41.306 --> 00:04:45.042
DISASTROUS PRESS CONFERENCE.

00:04:45.043 --> 00:04:46.377
THIS IS NOT GOING TO BE WITH THE

00:04:46.378 --> 00:04:47.978
DEMOCRATS THINK, I CAN TELL YOU

00:04:47.979 --> 00:04:49.413
THAT PEERED ALTHOUGH

00:04:49.414 --> 00:04:51.283
BOB MUELLER'S PEOPLE APPARENTLY

